{#
insight/_kind_chip.html.twig
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
The kind's icon on its coloured tile, shared by the radar panel and the
reading-pane strip so a parcel is the same amber square everywhere it appears.

Accepts:
  kind  InsightKind
  size  optional Tailwind sizing classes, default 'h-9 w-9'

One colour per kind, filled at 600 weight with white iconography, and
deliberately NOT the theme tokens: a 600-weight fill reads identically on both
themes, where a tokened tint would drift with whichever surface it lands on.
Both GitHub kinds share slate on purpose — issue and pull request are told
apart by their icon, and two greys nobody can name apart would only pretend to
say more. Full class names, spelled out per kind, because Tailwind's scanner
reads this file as text and a composed 'bg-' ~ colour would compile to nothing.

The kind's name rides along for anyone who cannot see the tile, so a card
still says "Parcel" rather than leaving the colour to do all the work.
#}
{% set tone = {
    'parcel':       'bg-amber-600',
    'flight':       'bg-sky-600',
    'ticket':       'bg-violet-600',
    'github-issue': 'bg-slate-600',
    'github-pr':    'bg-slate-600',
}[kind.value] ?? 'bg-slate-600' %}

<span class="flex {{ size|default('h-9 w-9') }} shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg {{ tone }} text-white shadow-sm">
    <i class="{{ kind.icon }} text-sm" aria-hidden="true"></i>
    <span class="sr-only">{{ kind.transKey|trans }}</span>
</span>
